steps.prompt:
THE RECORD. The runner has saved every answer and note already; this is for the things that live outside it. Collect, and send the whole results folder plus:
  - the module version and the .tgz sha256 from step 2, and Console Bridge's version;
  - which input you named safe, whether the PA was off, and whether the show was a copy;
  - the connection status string from step 5, word for word;
  - both grep counts from step 4 (both must be 0);
  - COMPANION'S LOG FILE for the day, not the UI buffer: ~/Library/Application Support/companion/logs/companion-<today>.0.log (times in it are UTC);
  - Console Bridge's own log over the same minutes;
  - anything you noticed that this sheet did not ask about, in your own words. That last one has been the most useful line in every run so far.
